{"pin":"BH00091","subcodes":[{"code":"BH00091","anchor":"","title":"Lawh-i-Haji Mirza Kamalu'd-Din","first_line":"Praise be to God Who hath distinguished Himself through glory and become singular in grandeur, and hath uttered the Word amongst all created things when [3.5s]... ...The question is that whereas in past Scriptures Isaac is said to have been the sacrifice; in the Qur’án this station is given to Ishmael. This is, undoubtedly, true","first_line_orig":"الحمد لله الذی توحد بالعزه و تفرد بالعظمه و نطق بالکلمه بین البریه اذا مرت ... ذکر من لدنا لمن اقبل الی الله و سمع ندآئه الاحلی اذ ارتفع بین الارض و السماء  ","language":"mixed","word_count":"4680","translations":[{"language":"ar","lang_name":"Arabic"},{"language":"orig","lang_name":"Original"}],"refs":[{"kind":"manuscript","code":"BLIB_Or11097#052","source":"BLIB_Or11097","locator":"052"},{"kind":"manuscript","code":"INBA07:296","source":"INBA07","locator":"296","url":"https://afnanlibrary.org/d/inba_v007/?page=150"},{"kind":"manuscript","code":"NLAI_BH4.124-146","source":"NLAI_BH4","locator":"124-146","url":"http://bluefin.live/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/NLAI.BH4_.pdf#page=124"},{"kind":"publication","code":"AVK2.100.14x","source":"AVK2","locator":"100.14x","url":"http://reference.bahai.org/fa/t/c/AK2/ak2-101.html"},{"kind":"publication","code":"AVK2.110.13x","source":"AVK2","locator":"110.13x","url":"http://reference.bahai.org/fa/t/c/AK2/ak2-111.html"},{"kind":"publication","code":"AVK2.197.04x","source":"AVK2","locator":"197.04x","url":"http://reference.bahai.org/fa/t/c/AK2/ak2-198.html"},{"kind":"publication","code":"MAS8.151ax","source":"MAS8","locator":"151ax","url":"http://reference.bahai.org/fa/t/b/MAS8/mas8-151.html"},{"kind":"publication","code":"MUH1.0365x","source":"MUH1","locator":"0365x","url":"https://bahai-library.com/bahailib/284.pdf#page=46"},{"kind":"publication","code":"TAH.190x","source":"TAH","locator":"190x","url":"https://bahai-library.com/bahailib/682.pdf#page=194"},{"kind":"translati